started: 2026-09-16
what: the operator's ask — worked examples of delimited control, from
  the literature, as TESTS so they cannot rot. Four: reverse-mode AD
  (Wang & Rompf 2018, the backward pass IS the continuation, measured
  against the analytic derivative), a generator (a recursive walk read
  as a lazy stream, no inversion of control), a web dialogue (Queinnec:
  the continuation stored between requests and resumed), and Danvy's
  typed printf on `Cont`, the one that needs answer-type modification.
